WEBVTT

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:26.970
Seeking out a single ray of light,
hito-suji no hikari wo motome

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:34.210
All I can do is wander on, no matter how far.
hitasura doko made mo tada samayou

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:42.950
As I breathe a sigh not unlike surrender,
akirame ni nita tameiki wo tsuki-nagara

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:52.270
I don't want to fear how I've been hurt, all the time.
kizutsuku koto wo osoretaku nai yo itsu mo

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:54.650
Set me free now!

00:00:54.670 --> 00:01:01.060
Come on, let it all go, to the far reaches of time,
saa tokihanate subete toki no kanata ni

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:01.080
From that which binds the soul!
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:06.910
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo
From that which binds the soul!

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:09.200
For my heartbeat!

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.690
Make freedom your weapon,
jiyuu wo buki ni

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:11.760
And you are sure to attain it!
kitto te ni ireru no yo

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:15.470
kitto te ni ireru no yo
And you are sure to attain it!

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:15.510
The power to believe and dream is there
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:21.590
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo
The power to believe and dream is there

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:21.630
for you to go on living.
ikite yuku tame ni

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:25.960
ikite yuku tame ni
for you to go on living.

00:01:54.780 --> 00:02:16.400
Yuji!!

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:17.400
Come on!

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:20.740
Yuji! Let me go!

00:02:20.810 --> 00:02:25.400
Yuji! Yuji! Yuji!

00:02:25.480 --> 00:02:27.040
Mar... lene...

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:33.690
Marlene...

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:35.020
H- he moved!

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:37.680
That's impossible!

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:48.070
Yuji...!

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:54.500
Why, you...!

00:03:07.460 --> 00:03:11.220
What is the head office doing!? Okay, force it open!

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:27.740
What shall we do?

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:30.780
It can no longer be avoided. Bring them both here.

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:34.340
Yuji... Yuji...!

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:35.580
Marlene...

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:40.150
Marlene.

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:48.360
Yuji!

00:03:48.430 --> 00:03:49.450
Thank goodness!

00:03:53.770 --> 00:03:54.700
There they are!

00:03:54.770 --> 00:03:57.400
Ah! Our precious research sample!

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:04.140
An elevator? Where the hell is it taking us?

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:15.150
I knew it...

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:23.490
Where's this?

00:04:26.130 --> 00:04:29.730
Code Number 2805...

00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:37.040
I am at a loss. I'm certain I ordered you to re-train at the drill facility, didn't I?

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:41.670
The High Council!

00:04:41.750 --> 00:04:45.010
2805, you can no longer talk your way out of this!

00:04:45.090 --> 00:04:48.680
This is clearly a rebellious action toward us!

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:54.020
So then, what exactly did you mean to do by taking a Sample along with you?

00:04:54.100 --> 00:05:00.690
I doubt you meant to take the injured as your partner for some sexual purpose.

00:05:00.770 --> 00:05:03.640
Answer, 2805. If you remain silent,

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:08.040
any further measures we take against you will only be that much more severe.

00:05:08.110 --> 00:05:14.050
Surely now you fully understand that you cannot escape from beneath our watch.

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:17.110
Answer us, Marlene Angel!

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:24.060
I don't know.

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:25.720
What?

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:31.160
As for what my intent was, I don't even know myself. I just...

00:05:31.270 --> 00:05:35.030
I just could not leave Yuji alone!

00:05:35.070 --> 00:05:39.670
It was impossible for me to forget about Yuji!

00:05:39.740 --> 00:05:42.000
Marlene!

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:44.600
There's something I'd like the High Council to answer as well!

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:47.670
What is it you're planning to do with Yuji!?

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:54.850
Yuji and I lived through that hellish world together. I have...

00:05:54.920 --> 00:05:58.520
I have the right to know!

00:06:01.100 --> 00:06:03.030
Right, you say?

00:06:03.100 --> 00:06:08.360
Absurd! Have you forgotten that all authority rests within the High Council!?

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:11.100
It is necessary for us to nip this evil in the bud.

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:14.540
Chairman Victor, let us vote immediately.

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:19.410
Very well. If that is what you have to ask,

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:20.880
I will make an exception

00:06:20.950 --> 00:06:24.380
and furnish you with information concerning the Sleepers.

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:26.390
Chairman Victor!

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:29.720
I do not wish to disrupt things any more myself.

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:33.350
However, in having your questions answered,

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:36.160
you will consent to turning over that Sample quietly, agreed?

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:38.990
W- we'll see...

00:06:39.070 --> 00:06:44.660
It was just two years ago when we first learned of the Sleepers.

00:06:44.740 --> 00:06:47.470
It was all made clear to us by a data disk

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:52.000
that rested in one room of some research facility.

00:06:52.080 --> 00:06:54.340
The Sleepers were those who, when diagnosed,

00:06:54.420 --> 00:06:56.540
were revealed to have the potential

00:06:56.620 --> 00:06:59.020
for developing abnormalities in their cellular tissues.

00:06:59.090 --> 00:07:00.680
At the time these diagnoses were made,

00:07:00.760 --> 00:07:03.250
there was no medical technique available

00:07:03.320 --> 00:07:06.020
to inhibit the propagation of these "B cells."

00:07:06.090 --> 00:07:08.360
There was nothing to do but to entrust their hopes to the future,

00:07:08.430 --> 00:07:14.370
as those who entered into that sleep must be aware of better than anyone.

00:07:14.440 --> 00:07:16.060
However, upon further investigation,

00:07:16.140 --> 00:07:19.440
we learned that it was possible the dormant B cells within the Sleepers

00:07:19.510 --> 00:07:23.910
could be the knockout punch to exterminate the Blue.

00:07:25.780 --> 00:07:26.710
What!?

00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:31.150
The B cells could be said to be an overly powerful antibody.

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:35.650
Their instinct is to excessively kill off whatever germs may invade the body.

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:39.320
If left alone, they could prove harmful to the body itself.

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:43.230
However, what would happen if the combative instincts the B cells possess

00:07:43.300 --> 00:07:48.000
were directly connected to the central nervous system of a machine?

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:49.930
By combining a Sleeper with an Armor Shrike,

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:52.370
the mightiest weapon to purge the germs named Blue

00:07:52.440 --> 00:07:58.350
that infest the Earth would be born.

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:00.680
That's why we went after Sleepers?

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:04.010
This new model of Armor Shrike would not only stimulate B cells,

00:08:04.090 --> 00:08:08.350
but it also have a moderate inhibiting system.

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:11.410
Once the antibody functionality of the B cells is expressed,

00:08:11.490 --> 00:08:15.020
the Sample's injuries should also recover more quickly.

00:08:15.100 --> 00:08:20.860
This is all for the Sample... I mean, the regrettably injured Kaido Yuji-kun himself.

00:08:20.940 --> 00:08:22.370
And more than anything,

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:27.200
to take back our Earth from the Blue that are running rampant over it!

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:33.980
We can defeat the Blue... at my hand?

00:08:34.050 --> 00:08:39.990
Me, who was unable to do anything except beg for someone else to save me?

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:43.150
Because of my illness, I'm able to fight?

00:08:43.220 --> 00:08:46.990
If so, then no longer will people like Yung and Joey...

00:08:47.060 --> 00:08:50.220
If so, then Elena and Dice...!

00:08:53.070 --> 00:08:56.330
I'm... I'm going to save the Earth?

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:59.340
Do you understand now?

00:08:59.410 --> 00:09:01.710
Leave him to us, and you, Code Number 2805,

00:09:01.780 --> 00:09:08.310
return now to your regular duties.

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:11.110
Marlene!

00:09:14.760 --> 00:09:18.020
In any case, I think it would be good to see how they do like this.

00:09:18.090 --> 00:09:19.080
What!?

00:09:23.100 --> 00:09:25.360
This Sleeper was awakened on the ground,

00:09:25.430 --> 00:09:29.030
and up to now has acted together with 2805.

00:09:29.140 --> 00:09:36.010
In order to activate up his B cells, 2805's existence should not be omitted.

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:36.980
Seno Miyagi!?

00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:42.310
Why, you! By what authority do you break into the High Council's line!?

00:09:42.380 --> 00:09:49.550
Authority? I am only making a suggestion to the High Council as a scientist.

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:53.650
I believe there are those of you who would be interested.

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:55.290
I would hate to see us lose precious data

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:59.320
by disrupting Kaido Yuji's unique environment.

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:03.060
In order to do this, are you saying we should allow 2805

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:05.000
to get away with the unauthorized actions she has taken?

00:10:05.070 --> 00:10:11.340
What nonsense! Disobeying orders is disobeying orders!

00:10:11.410 --> 00:10:14.900
The Sleepers are under the jurisdiction of the Science division.

00:10:14.980 --> 00:10:19.010
This should not be judged only from a military sense.

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:21.580
However, if we're dealing with the treatment afforded to one soldier,

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:23.350
it is a different matter.

00:10:23.420 --> 00:10:28.360
We call for the isolation and re-education of 2805!

00:10:28.460 --> 00:10:29.390
But...

00:10:29.430 --> 00:10:31.960
Outsiders will stay out of this!

00:10:32.030 --> 00:10:33.970
How presumptuous of you!

00:10:36.370 --> 00:10:37.740
Marlene...

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:43.240
Very well... If it's to fight the Blue,

00:10:43.310 --> 00:10:45.780
I will lend you my body as much as you like!

00:10:52.050 --> 00:10:56.510
However, from now on, as before, I will only have Marlene as my partner!

00:10:57.730 --> 00:10:58.750
Yuji...

00:11:36.100 --> 00:11:40.470
The secret military drill center for the Sleeper brigade is up ahead.

00:11:40.530 --> 00:11:45.370
Whether or not 2805 is allowed into the brigade depends on today's outcome.

00:11:45.440 --> 00:11:48.030
Seno Miyagi...

00:11:48.110 --> 00:11:49.630
Thanks to you, I got through yesterday,

00:11:49.710 --> 00:11:53.040
even though you might say I was rough on you...

00:11:53.110 --> 00:11:56.950
Look, I just said what I did out of scientific curiosity.

00:11:57.020 --> 00:12:01.390
If you do get into the brigade, the data will be that much more valuable.

00:12:01.460 --> 00:12:06.720
But why is it that the High Council is keeping all this a secret?

00:12:06.790 --> 00:12:10.290
Don't you think that if it were made known that the Sleepers could resist the Blue,

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:13.060
the military's determination would naturally be raised?

00:12:13.130 --> 00:12:14.690
Not entirely...

00:12:27.820 --> 00:12:32.010
Hmph! A lowly Science division chief should mind his own business!

00:12:32.090 --> 00:12:36.610
Well now, if that's the case, all we need do is take appropriate measures as well.

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:38.350
Isn't that so?

00:12:44.770 --> 00:12:46.360
What's all this?

00:13:22.140 --> 00:13:23.540
What are you doing, Alicia!?

00:13:23.600 --> 00:13:27.060
Your model has power far superior to the other!

00:13:27.140 --> 00:13:28.110
Brenda!

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:38.010
Over there is the Sleeper Brigade First Division Commander,

00:13:38.090 --> 00:13:44.020
Brenda Miren. The one next to her is Ben Davis.

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:48.030
So, for the time being, you will do exactly what your superiors tell you to do.

00:13:48.100 --> 00:13:52.160
All right, change out, Rick! Alicia, you've had enough too!

00:13:53.770 --> 00:13:59.070
Code Number 2805, I'm going to have you test your power right away.

00:14:08.120 --> 00:14:09.050
Marlene...

00:14:09.120 --> 00:14:12.610
Yow, damn! You've got to do something about this, Alicia!

00:14:12.690 --> 00:14:15.050
At this rate, no matter how many lives we have, it won't be enough!

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:16.850
Saying that isn't going to help any, you know!

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:20.050
This weird-looking machine just has dull responses!

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:24.060
After all, I'm not doing this because I want to, you know!

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:27.970
If you've got any gripes, you can just do it yourself, okay? Yourself!

00:14:37.410 --> 00:14:40.350
Wow. That lady's a Sleeper too?

00:14:40.410 --> 00:14:45.350
That lady too? Don't tell me, that girl is...?

00:14:45.420 --> 00:14:47.650
It can't be! Even if she is a Sleeper,

00:14:47.720 --> 00:14:51.020
they intend to send that little girl to fight against the Blue!?

00:14:51.090 --> 00:14:55.890
Unfortunately, a Sleeper's abilities are not related to their age or gender.

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:59.830
But then, you did see just now what kind of power the girl has.

00:15:03.100 --> 00:15:06.700
Looks like your pal is over there.

00:15:06.770 --> 00:15:10.470
Yuji... You're Kaido Yuji, right? I'm Rick Kilmer.

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:12.380
I'm just a pilot, but it's good to meet you.

00:15:12.450 --> 00:15:13.710
Ah, r- right.

00:15:13.780 --> 00:15:19.380
Yuji!? You don't mean, the same Yuji that woke up on the ground?

00:15:19.450 --> 00:15:21.390
Say, say, what is it like on the ground nowadays?

00:15:21.460 --> 00:15:25.720
Do they still have Big Donuts there? I just love the shakes they have!

00:15:25.790 --> 00:15:27.390
Huh? Hey, hold on...

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:31.360
Tell me! I was woken up here, so I don't know anything!

00:15:31.470 --> 00:15:34.230
Come on, we're both Sleepers here!

00:15:34.270 --> 00:15:38.000
Tell me all about how things are, Yuji!

00:15:38.070 --> 00:15:40.010
Oof, oww...!

00:15:40.070 --> 00:15:42.670
Ah, sorry!

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:48.340
Uh, yeah. Hey, that model you're trading out, it's a two-seater, right?

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:51.010
- I'm going too!
- Are you all right?

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:52.980
Marlene is my partner.

00:15:53.050 --> 00:15:56.680
If you don't see us work together, it's not much of test, right?

00:15:56.760 --> 00:15:58.850
Sure you can manage like that?

00:16:03.430 --> 00:16:05.020
"My partner," huh?

00:16:05.100 --> 00:16:07.900
Ah, come on, Yuji!

00:16:12.110 --> 00:16:13.370
Yuji!

00:16:13.440 --> 00:16:18.380
Not to worry! Let's hurry and get this test finished!

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:21.810
All you have to do is concentrate on the battle imaging.

00:16:21.880 --> 00:16:24.540
Using the image data forwarded to my instruments,

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:26.380
I'll take care of actually operating this.

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:27.720
Okay!

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:29.350
Commence battle drill!

00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:42.990
Here goes, Marlene!

00:16:43.070 --> 00:16:44.090
Stay sharp!

00:17:15.770 --> 00:17:16.760
Right!

00:17:25.450 --> 00:17:26.410
What!?

00:17:44.400 --> 00:17:46.130
Be careful! This guy's pretty good!

00:17:57.080 --> 00:17:58.670
Whoa, incredible!

00:17:58.750 --> 00:18:04.340
Yuji may be Yuji, but Marlene is really something for just reacting off of him.

00:18:04.420 --> 00:18:05.650
It's okay, isn't it?

00:18:05.720 --> 00:18:07.580
Calling other brigade members by their code numbers

00:18:07.650 --> 00:18:09.680
doesn't have much sex appeal.

00:18:09.760 --> 00:18:11.690
It hasn't been decided just yet.

00:18:20.430 --> 00:18:21.700
That clinches it!

00:18:28.440 --> 00:18:32.640
Nice. I love strong women like her.

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:34.440
I'm happy to hear it.

00:18:34.510 --> 00:18:37.970
In that case, would you care to accompany me tonight?

00:18:41.720 --> 00:18:45.160
Yuck! This whole bunch has no integrity at all!

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:56.330
I have been assigned to the First Division starting today.

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:59.670
Su Li Chang, from the Science division.

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:04.010
Is that so? You're late. No matter...

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:09.450
I'll leave the rest to you. Please forward me the data as stipulated.

00:19:22.100 --> 00:19:25.360
His gun is dead! Swing around to the right!

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:28.030
Got it!

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:29.100
This...

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:34.060
...will finish him!

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:38.340
What!?

00:19:56.730 --> 00:19:57.890
Dammit!

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:11.440
That's enough! Cease fighting!

00:20:18.090 --> 00:20:19.680
We got beat...

00:20:19.750 --> 00:20:21.690
For him to stop our motion with his unusable arm...

00:20:21.760 --> 00:20:24.190
judging from his way of fighting,

00:20:24.260 --> 00:20:29.190
the other pilot could be a Sleeper too.

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:38.300
Hm, that was quite a high-spirited little ride. I enjoyed it.

00:20:38.370 --> 00:20:39.740
Is that...?

00:20:47.380 --> 00:20:49.310
I'm sure he was there that one time...

00:21:30.760 --> 00:21:40.250
Although the days when we smiled again and again
hohoemi kasaneta hibi ga

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:46.380
Have passed away into dreams,
maboroshi ni natte mo

00:21:48.590 --> 00:21:55.530
I will surely not lose my way.
watashi wa kitto mayowanai

00:21:55.650 --> 00:22:01.700
To go on to the future,
mirai ni yuku tame ni

00:22:01.850 --> 00:22:08.120
To become an adult,
otona ni naru tame ni

00:22:08.480 --> 00:22:15.310
I again recall now the memories
mogaite kita omoide wo kokoro de

00:22:15.500 --> 00:22:20.470
twisting in my heart.
ima wa kurikaesu

00:22:20.570 --> 00:22:26.530
I'm living in one time,
hitotsu no toki wo iki

00:22:26.830 --> 00:22:32.810
While choosing two dreams,
futatsu no yume erabi

00:22:33.420 --> 00:22:40.290
And love taught me what it means...
soshite ai ga oshiete kureta yo ne

00:22:40.470 --> 00:22:47.150
to cherish someone.
hito wo omou imi

00:22:51.100 --> 00:22:56.040
That was definitely Yuji... But why was he together with Alicia?

00:22:56.110 --> 00:23:00.710
I've had it. Alicia has coaxed me into coming all the way to this place.

00:23:00.780 --> 00:23:03.720
The folks here just take too many risks.

00:23:03.780 --> 00:23:07.050
- Yuji!
- Marlene! What are you doing here?

00:23:07.120 --> 00:23:09.380
More importantly, Yuji, what is that?

00:23:09.460 --> 00:23:13.390
So that's it. This is what Alicia was talking about!
